From 4040f050c19c944c13d118a82d62caf67eb77542 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@iclaude.in>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:20:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 1 SEO fixes (P1-P8): restore /jpg-to-png route,
 FAQ/Article schema, metadata cleanup

- P1: rename app/jpg to png -> app/jpg-to-png (fixes 404; route was unreachable due to space in segment)
- P2: youtube-thumbnail-downloader robots index:false -> index:true (registry already marked indexable)
- P3: add generateFAQSchema() to lib/seo; render FAQPage JSON-LD on all 13 tool pages (ToolPage + 3 custom pages)
- P4: add generateArticleSchema() to lib/seo; datePublished/dateModified on guides; Article JSON-LD on both guides
- P5: remove duplicate WebSite/Organization JSON-LD from homepage and about/contact/privacy/terms (layout already injects once)
- P6: merge-pdf: demote duplicated wrapper H1 to H2 (single H1 per page)
- P7: add og:image to /tools/ metadata; de-duplicate About/Contact titles
- P8: retitle QR generator to target UPI/WiFi/WhatsApp queries

Verified: tsc clean, eslint unchanged (3 pre-existing errors), next build OK (27 routes), built HTML assertions pass.
